# Synology DSM writes thumbnail/extension sidecars next to every media file on
# this share, and macOS writes resource forks through the WebDAV mount. Neither
# is repository content and both are recreated by the file service, so they are
# ignored by name rather than deleted: `@eaDir/`, `._*`, `.DS_Store`.
@eaDir/
._*
.DS_Store


